WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
RUFUS: More than it had before,
yes.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:05.395
ALEX: The other reading: the
people who've committed twenty-six

00:00:05.395 --> 00:00:08.580
ALEX: billion dollars already
supply the compute, the
distribution,

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.766
ALEX: the sales channels. The
accountability is real, but

00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:14.951
ALEX: the power structure
underneath it was set before

00:00:14.951 --> 00:00:18.136
ALEX: the opening bell.

00:00:18.316 --> 00:00:20.909
JAMIE: Rufus, did you actually
consider calling twenty-six
billion

00:00:20.909 --> 00:00:23.502
JAMIE: a modest start?

00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:26.415
RUFUS: I considered it. Decided it
was uncharitable to

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:29.242
RUFUS: everyone's intelligence,
including my own.
